        "streak.motivation.5": ["de": "Routine schlägt Motivation.", "en": "Routine beats motivation.", "es": "La rutina vence a la motivación.", "fr": "La routine bat la motivation.", "it": "La routine batte la motivazione.", "pt": "A rotina vence a motivação."],
        "streak.motivation.6": ["de": "Kleine Schritte, große Wirkung.", "en": "Small steps, big impact.", "es": "Pequeños pasos, gran impacto.", "fr": "Petits pas, grands effets.", "it": "Piccoli passi, grande impatto.", "pt": "Pequenos passos, grande impacto."],
